    "description": "The Telecom SIM Swap API facilitates the seamless transition of mobile service from one SIM card to another. This operation is crucial for users who may have lost their SIM, need to upgrade to a new one, or are switching providers. It allows businesses or service providers to efficiently manage customer requests for SIM swaps, ensuring minimal disruption to service. Typical consumers include telecom operators and customer support systems handling user account changes and service continuity.",
